                label   "Sample Scale"
                type    float
                size    1
                default { 1.0 }
                range   { 0.05 4 }
                help    "Multiplies the samples per pixel, Nova's or Karma's; at least one sample remains. 0.25 previews a scene that is set up for its final quality at a quarter of the render time."
