                help    "Ends a frame after this many minutes of rendering with the samples it has by then: the image is denoised and written as when all samples are done, and the render statistics say how many samples it got (0: no limit). The limit is checked between passes, so a frame overruns it by at most one pass. Final renders only; the viewport renders on."
