                    "primary|shadow" "Visible Only to Primary and Shadow Rays"
                    "-primary" "Invisible to Primary Rays (Phantom)"
                    "-diffuse" "Invisible to Diffuse Rays"
                    "-diffuse&-reflect&-refract" "Invisible to Secondary Rays"
                    "-shadow" "Casts No Shadow"
                    "" "Invisible (Unrenderable)"
                }
                help    "The rays that see the object, in Karma's syntax: the ray types primary, shadow, diffuse, reflect, refract, volume and sss, * for all, a leading - for all but, & and | to combine. \"-primary\" hides an object from the camera while it still shadows and reflects; an empty value hides it from every ray. Unset: Karma's rendervisibility."
