                    "3" "Oriented Where Normals Exist"
                }
                help    "How curves render: flat ribbons turned towards each ray, round tubes (normals ignored), ribbons facing their normals, or ribbons where the curves have normals and tubes elsewhere. Linear curves cannot be oriented and face the ray. Unset: Karma's curve_style."
